---
import DetailLayout from '../../layouts/DetailLayout.astro';
import StarSection from '../../components/StarSection.astro';
import FlowDiagram from '../../components/FlowDiagram.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');

const kpis = [
  { label: "Application Time Saved", value: "85%", sub: "Per application cycle" },
  { label: "AI Match Scoring", value: "Groq LLM", sub: "Real-time JD vs CV evaluation" },
  { label: "Browser Integration", value: "Chrome Ext", "sub": "1-click ATS form auto-fill" },
  { label: "Crawler Pacing", value: "Anti-Ban", sub: "Vivaldi profile + 2s-8s jitter" }
];

const tools = [
  "JavaScript",
  "Node.js",
  "Express",
  "Puppeteer",
  "Groq LLM API",
  "Chrome Extension API",
  "Puppeteer / PDF Engine",
  "HTML5 & CSS3"
];

const jobFlowSteps = [
  { step: "01", title: "Job Board Crawling", desc: "Puppeteer launches Vivaldi profile, crawling target job boards with human-like jitter delays." },
  { step: "02", title: "Groq LLM Match Scoring", desc: "Evaluates raw job descriptions against master CV via /api/ai/matchscore, filtering >=40% matches." },
  { step: "03", title: "PDF CV Compilation", desc: "Express backend compiles ATS-compliant, role-tailored PDF resumes in real-time." },
  { step: "04", title: "1-Click ATS Auto-Fill", desc: "Manifest V3 Chrome extension auto-populates complex application fields directly in the browser." }
];
---

<DetailLayout
  title="Job Application Suite: Automated Form Filler & Tailored CV Engine"
  subtitle="An end-to-end career automation system featuring a 530KB interactive dashboard, Puppeteer job crawler, Groq LLM match scorer, and Chrome extension to eliminate job application friction."
  category="Full-Stack & Browser Automation"
  tag="AI & Builder Tool"
  role="Full-Stack Developer & Product Owner"
  timeline="2025 – 2026"
  tools={tools}
  kpis={kpis}
  backLink="/projects"
  backText="Back to AI & Builder Tools"
>

  <!-- SITUATION -->
  <StarSection type="situation" title="The High-Friction Job Application Process">
    <p>
      Modern job applications are notoriously repetitive. Candidates applying across multiple specialized disciplines (such as Performance Marketing, Technical SEO, and Digital Operations) are forced to manually copy-paste identical personal details, work histories, and portfolio links into hundreds of distinct Applicant Tracking System (ATS) portals (Greenhouse, Lever, Workday, LinkedIn, SEEK).
    </p>
    <p>
      Furthermore, submitting a generic CV significantly lowers interview callback rates, while manually editing bespoke PDFs for every single position introduces human fatigue and formatting errors.
    </p>
  </StarSection>

  <!-- TASK -->
  <StarSection type="task" title="Project Goals & Technical Requirements">
    <p class="font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">
      Design and build an integrated productivity suite with four core capabilities:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-2">
      <li><strong>Automated Job Hunting & Scoring:</strong> Crawl configured job boards overnight, extract raw job descriptions, and evaluate them against my CV using Groq LLM scoring.</li>
      <li><strong>1-Click Browser Auto-Fill:</strong> A lightweight Manifest V3 Chrome extension that detects ATS form inputs and populates verified career history instantly.</li>
      <li><strong>On-Demand PDF CV Engine:</strong> A backend service that dynamically generates role-tailored PDF CVs matching the exact focus of the job posting.</li>
      <li><strong>Centralized Application CRM:</strong> A rich dashboard to manage job statuses, email templates, companies, and interview notes in one place.</li>
    </ul>
  </StarSection>

  <!-- SYSTEM FLOW DIAGRAM -->
  <FlowDiagram title="End-to-End Application Automation Pipeline" steps={jobFlowSteps} />

  <!-- SCREENSHOT SHOWCASE -->
  <div class="my-10 space-y-8 not-prose">
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500">
        Live Interface Showcase
      </h3>
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-xl bg-slate-950">
        <img
          src={`${base}/images/projects/job-filler/dashboard-overview.png`}
          alt="Job Application Filler Dashboard"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
        />
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#0f172a] border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          <strong>Interactive CV Dashboard:</strong> Section-based resume editor with real-time field toggles, job tracking CRM, and dynamic PDF export controls.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-xl bg-slate-950">
        <img
          src={`${base}/images/projects/job-filler/autoapply-hunt.png`}
          alt="Auto-Apply Hunt Tab"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
        />
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#0f172a] border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          <strong>Auto-Apply Bot (Hunt & Queue):</strong> Puppeteer job hunter interface with Groq match score thresholds, crawl pacing rules, and application status queues.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ACTION -->
  <StarSection type="action" title="System Architecture & Implementation">
    <div class="space-y-5">
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">1. Puppeteer Crawler with Human-Like Anti-Ban Pacing</h4>
        <p>
          Constructed a standalone crawler (<code>autoapply/hunt.js</code>) that clones the user's active browser profile (preserving logins). It crawls configured job boards with randomized human-like jitter delays (2s to 8s) and anti-ban velocity limits (capped at 20 applications/hour).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">2. Groq LLM Match Scoring & Queue Engine</h4>
        <p>
          Each extracted job description is evaluated via <code>/api/ai/matchscore</code> powered by Groq. The engine compares role requirements against the master CV, generating a match percentage score and categorizing high-confidence postings into <code>applyqueue.json</code> for 1-click review.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">3. Manifest V3 Chrome Extension & Dynamic PDF Compiler</h4>
        <p>
          Engineered a browser extension that maps DOM fields across Workday, Greenhouse, and Lever portals to verified profile data. Simultaneously, a Puppeteer-based PDF compiler (<code>pdf-service.js</code>) renders role-tailored resumes on demand.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </StarSection>

  <!-- RESULT -->
  <StarSection type="result" title="Results & Productivity Gains">
    <p>
      The automation suite transformed an otherwise exhausting multi-hour daily process into a fast, automated workflow:
    </p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4 not-prose">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-[#0f172a] border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">Application Velocity</div>
        <div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-1">85% Faster Form Submission</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
          Complex multi-page ATS application forms that previously took 15 minutes are now completed in under 2 minutes.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-[#0f172a] border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">Targeted Quality</div>
        <div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-1">Zero-Manual Tailored CVs</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
          Generates role-specific PDF resumes on demand with perfect formatting and zero copy-paste typos.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </StarSection>

  <!-- Key Takeaway -->
  <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 mt-8">
    <h4 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
      Builder Takeaway
    </h4>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      Repetitive problems are software opportunities. Building a custom browser extension, crawler, and document compiler demonstrated how a small full-stack system can unlock massive compounding time savings.
    </p>
  </div>

</DetailLayout>
